    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/b3f338ed404546afb773cdf06afeb81d","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/b3f338ed404546afb773cdf06afeb81d","content":"\u003cp\u003eTo celebrate the end of the year, Roadlab branch managers were encourage to find community projects that resonated with them. This is four of those stories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/clrfbfnq/mauritius-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMauritius is set to host the 2022 African Economic Conference (AEC) from this December.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eWishes Do Come True\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn July of this year Roadlab held a Winter Clothing Drive at our Head Office in Germiston.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOver the previous two months our staff donated hundreds of items including clothing, shoes, bedding and tupperware.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eWe also hosted a pancake sale, the proceeds of which were used to buy almost 100 pairs of new winter socks.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eAll \u003ca tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eitems were donated to the \u003ca tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/avril.elizabeth.home/?__cft__[0]=AZVuDQErbnQRs8FSFPS8abVaVGY6jbgAdBRCWu2fsbLTsHTSJZrALGr-Z0ISkbq2RwOpzAlOi3pAbLyixHSWQ8zSLPoppZGFOiBVshBXtXQaq1yZIa6lDt90Y7DtSeKgB_o\u0026amp;__tn__=kK-R\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1qq9wsj xo1l8bm\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"xt0psk2\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvril Elizabeth Home for the Mentally Handicapped\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e, which supports 158 permanent residents within 2km of Roadlab\u0027s head office, and \u003ca tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ChildWelfareGermiston/?__cft__[0]=AZVuDQErbnQRs8FSFPS8abVaVGY6jbgAdBRCWu2fsbLTsHTSJZrALGr-Z0ISkbq2RwOpzAlOi3pAbLyixHSWQ8zSLPoppZGFOiBVshBXtXQaq1yZIa6lDt90Y7DtSeKgB_o\u0026amp;__tn__=kK-R\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1qq9wsj xo1l8bm\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"xt0psk2\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eChild Welfare Germiston\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e, which\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003ehas been taking care of vulnerable children and their families since 1912.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003eThis December we reached out to Child Welfare Germiston to find out if there was any way to support them during the holiday period and discovered their \"Make a Wish Come True\" campaign.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003eThe focus of the \"Make a Wish Come True\" campaign is to give the children they support their dream Christmas gift this year. \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003eThe response to the campaign was incredible.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\"Our Make A Wish Come True Campaign has received such an incredible outpouring of support, that we are blown away! We’ve had more pledges than we could have ever hoped for, and we have to say from the bottom of our hearts how very grateful we are! Because of you, some children out there who truly need something good will have a happy Christmas! Thank you all so much!\" - Child Welfare Germiston Facebook page\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003eThis week Roadlab donated some of the year\u0027s most commonly requested Christmas presents - cricket sets, soccer balls, dolls, cars - \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMauritius is home to a major tourism industry and many major construction projects with international financing.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eA Champion from Primrose \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA boxer from Edenvale\u0027s Rex Ultimate Boxing Gym.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpent much of his childhood visiting boxing gyms with his father, Charleton Koopman, whom he described as an inspiration and mentor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\"My father taught me everything I know and  learned a lot from him.\"\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlways attracted to boxing because of his father, Koopman loved all kinds of sports from a young age. He explained that being an athlete and being active is something he has already enjoyed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt 14 Koopman started his amateur boxing career and joined the Booysens Amateur Boxing Gym.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe has represented SA in the Zone Four African Championship and participated in the SA championships later that year where he won a gold medal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe decided to turn professional in 2018. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHe hopes to one day obtain a world championship title and impress others. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/zgcpbamt/mauritius-5.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMauritius is home to over 1.2 million people, giving it the highest population density in Africa.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"blog-h1 heading-h3\"\u003eLephalale Old Age Home\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnbalaba Development\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab contributed to various earthworks to help realise the recent successful development of an unobstructed view over the ocean and a lagoon for all of the villas of the Anbalaba development project, while protecting the raw landscape of beautiful Baie du Cap.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur site investigations helped to realise an exceptional view for the Anbalaba villas while maintaining total respect of the environment. As per their vision, Anbalaba favoured the installation of vegetated embankments and a retention basin rather than retaining walls and designed their drains to ensure that rainwater management respects the environment and the well-being of the local population.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eMossel Bay Centre\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnbalaba Development\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab contributed to various earthworks to help realise the recent successful development of an unobstructed view over the ocean and a lagoon for all of the villas of the Anbalaba development project, while protecting the raw landscape of beautiful Baie du Cap.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur site investigations helped to realise an exceptional view for the Anbalaba villas while maintaining total respect of the environment. As per their vision, Anbalaba favoured the installation of vegetated embankments and a retention basin rather than retaining walls and designed their drains to ensure that rainwater management respects the environment and the well-being of the local population.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReach out to us at +230 5446 3700 \u003c/strong\u003eor fill out the form below.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Mauritius operations team is ready to assess your needs or arrange a site visit.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of blue-chip companies, state enterprises, over 400 construction companies and more than 60 consulting firms across Africa.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
